      "properties": {
        "char_end": 321,
        "char_start": 180,
        "episode_id": "da36bd38-cbbe-5d64-91c1-e73f0866b824",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "Today's episode is supported by Betterment \u2014 automated investing that keeps your fees low and your plan boring. Visit betterment.com/podcast.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 18000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 12000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:102491b99843cd5a",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 426,
        "char_start": 321,
        "episode_id": "da36bd38-cbbe-5d64-91c1-e73f0866b824",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "I want to start with a warning that's aged well. Here's economist Nadia Sereni, from a talk back in 2016.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:speaker-03",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Nadia Sereni"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:c613cf3afacbe25e",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 484,
        "char_start": 441,
        "episode_id": "da36bd38-cbbe-5d64-91c1-e73f0866b824",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-03",
        "text": "Leverage feels free until the day it isn't.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:2956e8c4a499c6cb",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 602,
        "char_start": 497,
        "episode_id": "da36bd38-cbbe-5d64-91c1-e73f0866b824",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "That line held up. Most blow-ups I've seen weren't bad bets \u2014 they were fine bets financed the wrong way.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:90634cdfae6d9836",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 668,
        "char_start": 609,
        "episode_id": "da36bd38-cbbe-5d64-91c1-e73f0866b824",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "So the risk isn't the asset, it's the borrowing against it.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e05.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    }
